    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/e/ef/Housen_Ryofu_Hero_of_RakuyouQueen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251019181138\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Housen Ryofu Hero of RakuyouQueen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/e/ef/Housen_Ryofu_Hero_of_RakuyouQueen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20251019181138\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"709\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Housen Ryofu Hero of RakuyouQueen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Housen_Ryofu_Hero_of_RakuyouQueen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">外观</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FHousen_Ryofu%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>吕布有一副红润的肤色和海泡绿色的头发，总是扎成双马尾。她通常穿着乐古友学校制服，包括配套的红色西装外套和裙子，以及棕色鞋子。然而，与其他学生不同，她的袜子几乎及膝，而且不穿白色衬衫和领带，露出丰满乳房的乳沟。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a5/Ryofu_Hosen_HR_Veteran_Mercenary_Queens_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251019181137\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Ryofu Hosen HR Veteran Mercenary Queens Blade Unlimited Limit Break\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a5/Ryofu_Hosen_HR_Veteran_Mercenary_Queens_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20251019181137\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"903\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Ryofu Hosen HR Veteran Mercenary Queens Blade Unlimited Limit Break.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Ryofu_Hosen_HR_Veteran_Mercenary_Queens_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f4/Ryofu_Hosen_Hero_of_Rakuyou_SQueens_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251019181607\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Ryofu Hosen Hero of Rakuyou SQueens Blade Unlimited Limit Break\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/f/f4/Ryofu_Hosen_Hero_of_Rakuyou_SQueens_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20251019181607\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1007\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Ryofu Hosen Hero of Rakuyou SQueens Blade Unlimited Limit Break.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Ryofu_Hosen_Hero_of_Rakuyou_SQueens_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820055342\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in p